flf2a$ 6 3 155 -1 8 0 0 527

Chisel FIGfont by Philippe Majerus (http://www.phm.lu/) (phm-chisel.flf).
This font includes the ISO 8859-1 and Windows 1252 Latin-1 character sets, Japanese Katakana, Alphanumeric, and Hiragana as Katakana, and a few extras.
This font uses Unicode 13.0 characters (sextants, smooth sextants, and quadrants) and ANSI/VT control sequences for colors.
It works in FIGlet 2.2.5, but the width computation gets confused, so it can only be used for single lines.
It requires -w 9999 to avoid misplaced line breaks. It does not work at all in TOIlet 0.3, as escape sequences get removed.
Date: October 4-27 and December 12, 2024

